{% comment %}
  =====================================================
  FAMBOX Bento Grid + Bento Tile — Section v0.2 (Phase 1)
  =====================================================
  Spec:
    - brand/fambox/design-system/components/bento-grid.md (L4)
    - brand/fambox/design-system/components/bento-tile.md (L3)
  Spec date: 2026-04-28
  Figma:
    - Bento Grid Component Set 91:107 (3 variants)
    - Bento Tile Component Set 87:26 (40 variants = 4×5×2 featured)
  Implementation date: 2026-05-12

  Grid Variants (3):
    - standard:  自由配置 (PC 12 col / Tablet 6 / SP 1)
    - editorial: 主構図ルール強制 (対角線 + 主役 2x2 最低 1 個 / DNA 反映ページ)
    - autofit:   auto-fit + dense (KPI ギャラリー / 商品一覧)

  Tile Variants (4):
    - standard:   Card Standard 継承 (title + body + 任意 CTA)
    - glass:      背景画像 + Glass 1-5 opacity overlay (ヒーロー級)
    - image-fill: 画像が全面 + テキスト下部 overlay (写真主役)
    - stat-focus: 大型数字 56px + ラベル (KPI 訴求)

  Tile Sizes (5):
    - 1x1 (small)  / 2x1 (横長) / 1x2 (縦長)
    - 2x2 (主役推奨) / 3x2 (メガ)

  Tile Featured: false / true (Drive 2px stroke で主役識別)

  Phase 1 範囲:
    - 1 section で Grid Variant + Tile Variant×Size×Featured 全組合せ対応
    - DNA Anti を CSS で防げる範囲で予防:
      * Grid gap < 16px → 16px clamp
      * 全 tile 同 size 単調並列 → Lint 警告 (HTML コメント)
      * Drive 全タイル背景 → CSS は許容、運用で防ぐ
    - 4-9 tile 推奨 (blocks の limit 12)

  v0.3 候補:
    - Editorial variant の主構図 Lint (主役 2x2 最低 1 個チェック)
    - Glass の 5 階調 modifier 完備
    - Image fill バインド (現状 image_url)
    - Parallax (Glass tile の背景画像)
=====================================================
{% endcomment %}

<section class="bento-section" data-gtag-section="bento_{{ section.settings.grid_variant }}">
  <div class="bento-section__inner">

    {%- if section.settings.title != blank or section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <header class="bento-section__header">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="bento-section__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="bento-section__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <p class="bento-section__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </header>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="bento-grid bento-grid-{{ section.settings.grid_variant }} bento-gap--{{ section.settings.gap_size }}">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'tile' -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign tile_variant = block.settings.tile_variant
            assign tile_size = block.settings.tile_size
            assign tile_featured = block.settings.is_featured
            assign tag = 'article'
            if block.settings.tile_url != blank
              assign tag = 'a'
            endif
          -%}

          {%- if tag == 'a' -%}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.tile_url }}"
               class="bento-tile bento-{{ tile_variant }} tile-{{ tile_size }}{% if tile_featured %} is-featured{% endif %}"
               {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
               {% if block.settings.bg_image != blank and tile_variant == 'glass' %}style="background-image: url('{{ block.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}');"{% endif %}
               data-gtag-tile="{{ block.settings.title | default: tile_variant | handleize }}">
          {%- else -%}
            <article class="bento-tile bento-{{ tile_variant }} tile-{{ tile_size }}{% if tile_featured %} is-featured{% endif %}"
                     {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                     {% if block.settings.bg_image != blank and tile_variant == 'glass' %}style="background-image: url('{{ block.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}');"{% endif %}>
          {%- endif -%}

            {%- case tile_variant -%}

            {%- when 'standard' -%}
              {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
                <p class="bento-tile__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                <h3 class="bento-tile__title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.body != blank -%}
                <p class="bento-tile__text">{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

            {%- when 'glass' -%}
              {%- comment -%} 背景画像は style 属性で指定済、overlay は ::before で {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
                <p class="bento-tile__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                <h3 class="bento-tile__title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.body != blank -%}
                <p class="bento-tile__text">{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

            {%- when 'image-fill' -%}
              {%- if block.settings.bg_image != blank -%}
                <img src="{{ block.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1800 }}"
                     alt="{{ block.settings.bg_image_alt | default: block.settings.title | escape }}"
                     class="bento-tile__media"
                     loading="lazy"
                     width="1800" height="1200">
              {%- endif -%}
              <div class="bento-tile__overlay">
                {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                  <h3 class="bento-tile__title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.body != blank -%}
                  <p class="bento-tile__text">{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>

            {%- when 'stat-focus' -%}
              <p class="bento-stat-focus__value">
                {{ block.settings.stat_value }}{%- if block.settings.stat_unit != blank -%}<span class="bento-stat-focus__unit">{{ block.settings.stat_unit }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </p>
              {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                <p class="bento-stat-focus__label">{{ block.settings.title }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

            {%- endcase -%}

          {%- if tag == 'a' -%}
            </a>
          {%- else -%}
            </article>
          {%- endif -%}

        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* === Section base === */
  .bento-section {
    width: 100%;
    padding-block: var(--space-7, 64px);
  }
  .bento-section__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-max, 1440px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-3, 24px);
  }

  /* === Header === */
  .bento-section__header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6, 48px);
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .bento-section__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-en, 'Poppins', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption, 12px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold, 600);
    color: var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1, 8px);
  }
  .bento-section__title {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2, 32px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2, 16px);
  }
  .bento-section__intro {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body, 16px);
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* === Bento Grid 基本 (spec v0.2 準拠) === */
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: minmax(160px, auto);
    gap: var(--space-4, 32px);
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-3, 24px);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
    }
  }

  /* Gap modifiers (DNA Anti 「< 16px」を clamp で防御) */
  .bento-gap--sm { gap: var(--space-2, 16px); }
  .bento-gap--md { gap: var(--space-3, 24px); }
  .bento-gap--lg { gap: var(--space-4, 32px); }

  /* Grid variants */
  .bento-grid-editorial { gap: var(--space-4, 32px); }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) { .bento-grid-editorial { gap: var(--space-3, 24px); } }
  .bento-grid-autofit {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    grid-auto-flow: dense;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .bento-grid-autofit { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
  }

  /* === Bento Tile 基本 === */
  .bento-tile {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
    background: var(--bg-primary, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light, #ececec);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    padding: var(--space-3, 24px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04));
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: box-shadow var(--duration-base, 0.3s) var(--ease-out),
                transform var(--duration-base, 0.3s) var(--ease-out);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    position: relative;
  }
  .bento-tile:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-3, 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .bento-tile:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus-ring, #fb4c15);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .bento-tile.is-featured {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    padding: calc(var(--space-3, 24px) - 1px);
  }

  /* === Tile sizes (PC) === */
  .tile-1x1 { grid-column: span 1; grid-row: span 1; }
  .tile-2x1 { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 1; }
  .tile-1x2 { grid-column: span 1; grid-row: span 2; }
  .tile-2x2 { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: span 2; }
  .tile-3x2 { grid-column: span 3; grid-row: span 2; }

  /* SP / Tablet 縮退 */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .tile-2x1, .tile-2x2, .tile-3x2 { grid-column: span 1; }
    .tile-1x2, .tile-2x2 { grid-row: span 1; }
  }

  /* === 共通 内部要素 === */
  .bento-tile__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-en, 'Poppins', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption, 12px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold, 600);
    color: var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bento-tile__title {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3, 24px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bento-tile__text {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body, 16px);
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* === Variant: Glass === */
  .bento-glass {
    position: relative;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    border: none;
    isolation: isolate;
    color: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
  }
  .bento-glass::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .bento-glass > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .bento-glass .bento-tile__title,
  .bento-glass .bento-tile__text { color: var(--color-white, #ffffff); }

  /* === Variant: Image-fill === */
  .bento-image-fill {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }
  .bento-image-fill .bento-tile__media {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 0;
    display: block;
  }
  .bento-image-fill .bento-tile__overlay {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: var(--space-3, 24px);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
    color: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
  }
  .bento-image-fill .bento-tile__title,
  .bento-image-fill .bento-tile__text { color: var(--color-white, #ffffff); }

  /* === Variant: Stat-focus === */
  .bento-stat-focus {
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .bento-stat-focus__value {
    font-family: var(--font-en, 'Poppins', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-display, 56px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bento-stat-focus__unit {
    font-size: 0.4em;
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    margin-left: var(--space-1, 8px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular, 400);
  }
  .bento-stat-focus__label {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body, 16px);
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    margin: var(--space-1, 8px) 0 0;
  }

  /* === reduced motion === */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .bento-tile { transition: none; }
    .bento-tile:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>

